WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.335
Hi! This is Sydney Sweeney.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.704
I am here on the Sony backlot,

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.573
and I'm going to take you
into stage 14

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.809
and show you where we film
<i> Euphoria.</i>

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:13.246
♪ (MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:23.956
Well, hello!

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:26.659
Welcome to the<i> Euphoria</i>
base camp.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.560
-Say hello.
-Hey!

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:30.062
SYDNEY SWEENEY: We're doing
a base camp tour.

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:31.030
Oh!

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:35.468
This is the hair and makeup
where everything happens.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:39.706
<i> You can see all the pictures</i>

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:42.175
<i> of different makeup looks
 that we've done.</i>

00:00:44.076 --> 00:00:46.612
-(POLICE SIRENS WAILING)
-Cops are after us.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:47.714
(GIGGLING)

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:49.649
<i> Do you wanna take 'em
 to the set?</i>

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:50.650
Cool.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.251
You were honestly made for this.

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:53.452
(CHUCKLES)

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:55.188
You need to own one of these.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.595
SWEENEY:
<i> They're working right now.</i>

00:01:03.095 --> 00:01:06.666
So literally, it's just like...
facades. It's crazy.

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.001
<i> Usually we come here
and everything's already done...</i>

00:01:09.101 --> 00:01:10.236
-ALEXA DEMIE:<i>  Set up and--
 -Yeah.</i>

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:12.272
Wait, let's see.
This is the map.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:15.040
-Dressing room.
-DEMIE: Uh...

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:17.077
Okay, so this is what
they're building.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.846
Yeah. That's so cool.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.549
Can we take them
to the other stage?

00:01:23.849 --> 00:01:26.285
-Ooh, we got our cart over here.
-Wrong cart.

00:01:26.685 --> 00:01:30.390
Nope. Wrong cart! (CHUCKLES)
Going to this cart over here.

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:34.194
-Hey, Syd. I got you...
-(GASPS)

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:36.796
-They're warm.
-Cookies!

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:40.433
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:42.101
SWEENEY: Going on in!

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:44.570
We're filming episode seven
and eight right now.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.238
Filming school stuff.

00:01:46.338 --> 00:01:47.873
-What?!
-Oh, my God. Hi!

00:01:47.973 --> 00:01:49.541
-Well, hello!
-What are you doing here?

00:01:50.042 --> 00:01:51.744
-What are you doing here? Oh!
-Get in here.

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:52.911
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:54.146
(LAUGHTER)

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:56.081
This is our school!

00:01:56.982 --> 00:02:00.152
And here, we have cast holding
right now but sometimes,

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:02.655
it is set as a classroom.

00:02:03.589 --> 00:02:06.058
-There's cameras on both sides.
-It's on both sides?

00:02:06.325 --> 00:02:08.394
So it's recording here
and a camera here.

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:09.996
-What? (LAUGHS)
-The whole time?

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.698
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:18.004
Welcome to our school dance!

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:21.708
<i> There's 3,000 stars up there.</i>

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:24.611
Take them into the balloon hall!

00:02:26.812 --> 00:02:28.147
This is the balloon hall.

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:32.451
Do you guys wanna pose for a--
a portrait? Click!

00:02:32.551 --> 00:02:36.355
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:02:36.455 --> 00:02:39.792
You will see tons of people
dancing here, music.

00:02:39.892 --> 00:02:40.927
(CHATTERING)

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:50.303
Bye for now!

00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:54.707 line:0%
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

